5) / 嗡鸣者收尾阶段（拨款，对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: hummers end stage (funded, proactive) (difficulty 5) / hummers end stage (funded, cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-420.json","optionIndex":1,"option":"first_contact.415.B"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"special_projects:UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT","parent":"n3","via":{"option":"first_contact.420.A","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:6526"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"first_contact.422","parent":"n4","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:74"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.415","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"频率问题","en":"A Problem of Frequencies"},"texts":[{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的信号的初期解读工作使[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]陷入困惑。它们似乎主要是白噪音，没有任何可以被识别为语言的东西。有一段时间，人们甚至怀疑我们是否在处理一个智慧物种的语言，尽管有可见的证据表明他们确实使用了某种技术。\n\n只有当我们的[This.Owner.GetResearchers]试着调整我们的仪器以检测超出我们[This.Owner.GetSpeciesEarNamePlural]正常听力范围的声音时，才检测到某种像是语言的东西。不幸的是，这对我们解读工作提出了相当大的挑战，因为在不借助仪器的情况下，我们根本听不见它们……","en":"Initial readings of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] signals left [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] bewildered. They seemed to be mainly white noise, devoid of anything which could be recognized as language. For a time, there were even doubts as to whether we were dealing with the utterings of an intelligent species, despite the visual evidence of their use of technology.\n\nIt was only when our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] experimented with tuning our instruments to detect sounds well outside the normal range frequencies of our [This.Owner.GetSpeciesEarNamePlural] that patterns indicative of a language were detected. Unfortunately, this poses considerable challenges for our quest to come to understand them, since we will not be able to hear them at all without assistance..."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.415.A","label":{"zh":"我们必须坚持下去。","en":"We will have to persevere."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"这可能要花点时间……","en":"This may take a while..."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.425","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-420.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：嗡鸣者收尾阶段（坚持，对方主动）(难度8) / 嗡鸣者收尾阶段（坚持，对方谨慎）(难度10)","en":"Stage: hummers end stage (persevered, proactive) (difficulty 8) / hummers end stage (persevered, cautious) (difficulty 10)"},"story":"event-first-contact-420"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"first_contact.415.B","label":{"zh":"当然，一点额外的投资会有帮助？","en":"Surely some extra funding will help?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.420","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-420.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：嗡鸣者收尾阶段（拨款，对方主动）(难度5) / 嗡鸣者收尾阶段（拨款，对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: hummers end stage (funded, proactive) (difficulty 5) / hummers end stage (funded, cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"story":"event-first-contact-420"}],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"resource_stockpile_compare","arg":"{…}","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":6432},"sets":["first_contact_hummers_chain"],"names":{"This.Leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}},"notes":[{"zh":"审阅注：选项A坚持（不花钱）→ “无行动”收尾阶段（难度较高：对方主动8 / 谨慎10）→ 425；选项B需要1000能量，扣除后进入拨款收尾阶段（5 / 7）→ 420。","en":"Review note: A (persevere, free) enters the no-action end stage (harder: difficulty 8 proactive / 10 cautious) → 425; B costs 1000 energy and enters the funded end stage (5 / 7) → 420.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"first_contact.425","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]被解密","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName] Decoded"},"texts":[{"z