form of communication used by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] sufficiently to establish preliminary contact. It seems that they call themselves the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. Inevitably, communication can only happen with the help of communication systems specifically tuned to their language.\n\nThis would appear to be problematic for hopes of fluent conversation with them, but our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] see it differently. Buoyed by their success and still benefiting from the extra funding we provided them, they have drawn up a proposal to consolidate our learnings from this experience into something that will be of generally applicable use. They believe that, by fine-tuning the software used here, they will be able to build what they are calling a \"universal translator\", which - if provided with enough information - will be able to instantaneously suggest translations for phrases uttered in any given language."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.420.A","label":{"zh":"无限的沟通机会尽在掌控！","en":"Unlimited communication possibilities are within our grasp!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:6526","story":"event-first-contact-420"},{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12901","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":