422.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"special_projects:UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"万能翻译器","en":"The Universal Translator"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的研究人员承诺将利用近来与[contacted_hummers.GetSpeciesNamePlural]的遭遇经历，将作为一个万能的、可即刻将任何给定的语言翻译成我们自己的语言的翻译系统的起点。即使他们最终未能成功，我们也希望他们能够对我们的通讯系统进行显著改进。","en":"Our researchers promise that our recent encounter with the [contacted_hummers.GetSpeciesNamePlural] has given them the beginnings of a translation system able to translate any given language into our own instantly. Even if they fall short of this, it is our hope that they will be able to upgrade our communication systems considerably."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"first_contact.422","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:74","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-first-contact-420"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt","line":63},"names":{"contacted_hummers.GetSpeciesNamePlural":{"zh":"该物种","en":"the species"}}},{"id":"first_contact.422","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"万能翻译器","en":"The Universal Translator"},"texts":[{"zh":"所谓“万能翻译器”的原型机已经成功制成。虽然其效果相较于[This.Owner.GetResearchers]所设想的那种能够即时对任何未知语言进行翻译的设备打了折扣，但仍不失为对现有翻译系统的巨大改进。光明的前景，即解除与包括[contacted_hummers.GetName]在内的任何接触到的外星人的交流障碍，已摆在眼前。","en":"Prototyping of the so-called \"universal translator\" has finished in success. Although the results fall short of the boldest promises of our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] of a device capable of instantly translating even unknown languages, it is a massive improvement over existing translation systems. Already, there are promises of vast boons as barriers to communication with the [contacted_hummers.GetName] and other alien acquaintances are lifted."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9ff9150221c27e4aaa09.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.422.A","label":{"zh":"迟早会派上用场的。","en":"This will come in useful."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":6537},"ending":{"label":{"zh":"结局：通用翻译器","en":"Ending: the universal translator"},"note":{"zh":"项目完成，获得“通用翻译器”国家修正。","en":"The project completes and grants the universal_translator modifier."}}}],"summary":{"text":"# 频率问题 / A Problem of Frequencies\n- 分类 Category：文明纪事 Society (C7) · 首次接触阶段链 first-contact stage chain（首个事件「频率问题」first_contact.415）\n- 来源 Sources：`events/first_contact_events.txt:7411–7586` · `common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:63–75` · `common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:567–602, 1975–2052`\n- 审阅 Reviewed：2026-10-13（c7b-society）\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n第二阶段抽取，权重 10；本方须持有 first_contact_skill_1…4 之一的修正（“新手不得入内”），不得是格式塔，未发生过此链；对方不得是格式塔，同种族类别 ×0.5（`common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:568–602`）。/ Stage-2 weight 10; needs one of the first_contact_skill_1…4 modifiers, a non-gestalt owner and contact, and no earlier run of the chain; ×0.5 when both are the same species class.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n1. **频率问题（415）**：对方的信号像白噪声。/ The signals look like white noise.\n   - A 坚持 → 无行动收尾（难度8/10）→ **425 译码完成**。/ Persevere → 425.\n   - B 追加经费（-1000 能量，需有存量）→ 拨款收尾（难度5/7）→ **420 译码完成**。/ Pay 1000 energy → 420.\n2. 420 另外启用特殊项目“通用翻译器”（3000 社会学）→ 完成后 **422 通用翻译器**。/ 420 also enables the Universal Translator project → 422.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n- 425 与 420 是花钱与否两条路线的结果，二选一。/ 425 and 420 are the results of the two options.\n- 所有收尾选项都调用 finish_first_contact_effect（建立正式通讯，之后按帝国类型转入后续事件，如反向接触、教程、商队等），并调用 first_contact_inform_intel。 / Every ending option calls finish_first_contact_effect (opens regular communications, then routes to follow-ups such as reverse first contact, tutorial, caravaneer events) and first_contact_inform_intel.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n无按文明身份变化的文本，仅选项B需要能量。/ Only option B requires energy.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对 Checked：415–425、项目 UNIVERSAL_TRANSLATOR_PROJECT、四个嗡鸣者阶段。\n- 审阅改动 Changes：并入 415 与 425（原 event-first-contact-425），连接阶段；420→项目→422。/ Merged 415 and 425 (previous event-first-contact-425 story) and linked the project.\n","path":"summaries/event-first-contact-420.md"}}